    <mxCell id="gha_note" value="1. GitHub OIDC token → AssumeRole&#xa;2. dbks-infra-iam-role-gha-deploy assumed (no static keys)&#xa;3. terraform plan / apply with -var-file&#xa;4. State read/write: S3 + DynamoDB lock&#xa;5. Secrets read from Secrets Manager&#xa;Branch: dev → DEV env | main → PROD env" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="1530" y="1040" width="470" height="100" as="geometry"/>
